## Session Context

Before starting work in this repo, load tool awareness for gimp-mcp:

- 18 portmanteau tools: gimp_file, gimp_transform, gimp_color, gimp_filter, gimp_layer, gimp_analysis, gimp_batch, gimp_system, gimp_pdb (universal PDB proxy for ~1000 procedures), gimp_workspace, gimp_channel, gimp_animation, gimp_paths, gimp_parasites, gimp_gmic, gimp_gegl, gimp_color_management, gimp_snapshot.
- Transports: stdio (Claude Desktop, `uv run python -m gimp_mcp.main`) + HTTP/SSE backend on :10773, frontend on :10772, live GIMP bridge on :10824.
- Without the GIMP bridge plugin all tools fall back to headless CLI (`gimp-console-3.exe`).
- Key files: src/gimp_mcp/main.py (tool registration), src/gimp_mcp/http_app.py (REST), src/gimp_mcp/bridge_wrapper.py (live TCP bridge), skills/gimp-expert/SKILL.md (agent guidance).
- Gates: `uv run ruff check src/`, `uv run pytest tests/ -q`, frontend `tsc --noEmit` + `biome ci`.
